fcitx5-shadowbar (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade built-in local AI translation model to Hunyuan Hy-MT2-1.8B (2bit Q2_0C):
    - Replace legacy 1.25bit preset with Hy-MT2-1.8B-2Bit while keeping custom
      local GGUF paths, online LLMs, DeepL/Google Free APIs, and offline dicts
    - Auto-migrate legacy `variant = "1.25bit"` TOML configurations cleanly
  * Add patched llama-server (sjl623/llama.cpp@1e411d8, PR #22836) tooling:
    - Add scripts/build_llama_server.sh (Q2_0C + hunyuan-dense + Vulkan/CPU,
      with --prebuilt fallback) and --with-llama-server installer options
    - Add UI one-click engine downloader (`⬇ 下载引擎`), clear format
      incompatibility diagnostics, and CI Release packaging for
      shadowbar-llama-server-linux-amd64.tar.gz

