fcitx5-shadowbar (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix crash on startup in Qt6 floating UI (`OpaquePopupEventFilter`):
    - Add re-entrancy guard and skip redundant stylesheet/attribute updates to
      prevent infinite `QEvent::StyleChange` recursion (`SIGSEGV`).

